WEBVTT

00:00:00.552 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.223 --> 00:00:05.196
After your treatment, would you like to keep the invoice, to check it later,

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:06.590
or send it to your company?

00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:07.950
No paper needed.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:09.870
Your invoice is right there on your phone.

00:00:10.489 --> 00:00:14.602
When you pay at the counter, the staff tap Show QR code on their screen.

00:00:15.031 --> 00:00:17.402
Open your phone's camera, and scan the code.

00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:19.652
The invoice opens straight away:

00:00:19.744 --> 00:00:25.712
the salon's name, the invoice number, the date and time, your services, the tax,

00:00:25.662 --> 00:00:26.452
the total,

00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:27.332
and how you paid.

00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:31.332
Take a screenshot, or save the link, to look at it again any time.

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:32.941
Not at the counter?

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.101
The staff can email the invoice to you.

00:00:35.361 --> 00:00:37.661
Open the email, and tap the link to see it.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.901
The invoice also has its own QR code, so you can scan it again next time.

00:00:42.232 --> 00:00:43.261
Now take the quiz below!
